      ],
      "section_title": "3.4 安装位置要求",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n设备的防护等级为IP66，可安装在户外环境。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.196,
        560.671,
        285.134,
        571.624
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-8B472CB5016F3DFE",
      "document_id": "DOC-5067B181346D",
      "source_sha256": "985ab7688c0888ec68a5b671d2032bb8efd112a6affc42621bcf8c208b870e8e",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "printed_page_label": "14",
      "block_order": 19,
      "section_id": "SEC-EFD5C887FFBA10F1",
      "section_path": [
        "3 机械安装",
        "3.4 安装位置要求"
      ],
      "section_title": "3.4 安装位置要求",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n请将设备安装在通风环境中，确保设备通风散热良好。如果设备安装在密闭环境，需要加\n装散热装置或通风装置。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.196,
        575.671,
        453.362,
        600.124
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-42138DD7016803A0",
      "document_id": "DOC-5067B181346D",
      "source_sha256": "985ab7688c0888ec68a5b671d2032bb8efd112a6affc42621bcf8c208b870e8e",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "printed_page_label": "14",
      "block_order": 20,
      "section_id": "SEC-EFD5C887FFBA10F1",
      "section_path": [
        "3 机械安装",
        "3.4 安装位置要求"
      ],
      "section_title": "3.4 安装位置要求",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n环境温度范围为：-40℃~ +60℃，相对环境湿度≤100%，无冷凝。湿度过大可能会引起\n内部元器件损坏。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.196,
        604.171,
        445.352,
        628.624
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
      "needs_review": false,
      "review_notes": []
    },
    {
      "block_id": "BLK-AF4E1673928170EC",
      "document_id": "DOC-5067B181346D",
      "source_sha256": "985ab7688c0888ec68a5b671d2032bb8efd112a6affc42621bcf8c208b870e8e",
      "parser_version": "1.5.0",
      "pdf_page": 20,
      "printed_page_label": "14",
      "block_order": 21,
      "section_id": "SEC-EFD5C887FFBA10F1",
      "section_path": [
        "3 机械安装",
        "3.4 安装位置要求"
      ],
      "section_title": "3.4 安装位置要求",
      "block_type": "list",
      "text": "•\n注意设备防潮、防湿；严禁将设备安装在空调口、通风口、机房出线窗等易漏水位置下\n方，以防止液体进入设备内部造成设备故障或短路。",
      "table_cells": null,
      "bbox": [
        88.196,
        632.671,
        444.362,
        657.124
      ],
      "extraction_method": "native_text",
